                "title": "Round Door Knob Set, Baldwin ROU-TRR",
                "description": "The Round Knob set is perfect for traditional style homes. We love this half-round knob because it is so versatile. It is available in a dummy, passage, privacy, and a keyed entry. Choose from one of the beautiful finishes including polished brass, satin nickel, and polished chrome. The Round Knobset will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 2-1/2 inches thick; and an adjustable latch accommodates 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. \r\n",
